<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER SHOWCASE-ANDERLECHT V EKEREN FACTS, FIGURES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-ANDERLECHT V EKEREN FACTS, FIGURES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Facts and figures for Sunday's</p>
<p>Belgian Cup final between Anderlecht and Ekeren:</p>
<p>Anderlecht</p>
<p>Founded May 27, 1908</p>
<p>Major honours:</p>
<p>European Cup Winners' Cup winners 1976 and 1978</p>
<p>UEFA Cup winners 1983</p>
<p>European Super Cup 1976, 1978</p>
<p>Belgian League champions (record 24 times) 1947, 1949, 1950,</p>
<p>1951, 1954, 1955, 1956, 1959, 1962, 1964, 1965, 1966, 1967,</p>
<p>1968, 1972, 1974, 1981, 1985, 1986, 1987, 1991, 1993, 1994, 1995</p>
<p>Belgian Cup winners 1965, 1972, 1973, 1975, 1976, 1988, 1989,</p>
<p>1994</p>
<p>Ground: Constant Vanden Stock stadium (named after club</p>
<p>president from 1977 to 1996 who was then succeeded by his son</p>
<p>Roger), capacity 28,063</p>
<p>Manager: Johan Boskamp (Netherlands)</p>
<p>Anderlecht have also finished 15 times runners-up in the league</p>
<p>since the end of World War Two, and have always finished in THE</p>
<p>top six of the standings since then.</p>
<p>League record in last eight years:</p>
<p>1989/90-2, 1990/91-1, 1991/92-2, 1992/93-1, 1993/94-1,</p>
<p>1994/95-1, 1995/96-2, 1996/97-4</p>
<p>Ekeren</p>
<p>Founded August 2, 1920</p>
<p>Major honours: none</p>
<p>First season in first division 1989-1990</p>
<p>Ground: Veltwijck stadium, capacity 8,500</p>
<p>Manager: Herman Helleputte (Belgium)</p>
<p>League record in last eight years:</p>
<p>1989/90-13, 1990/91-5, 1991/92-8, 1992/93-14, 1993/94-10,</p>
<p>1994/95-6, 1995/96-3, 1996/97-10</p>
<p>Anderlecht v Ekeren league record in last six seasons:</p>
<p>Wins: Anderlecht 8, Ekeren 1</p>
<p>Draws: 3</p>
<p>Goals: Anderlecht 34, Ekeren 18</p>
<p>Leading winners of Belgian Cup, from 41 previous finals:</p>
<p>8 - Anderlecht</p>
<p>7 - Club Brugge</p>
<p>5 - Standard Liege</p>
<p>* Anderlecht deputy coach Jean Dockx has played in seven</p>
<p>finals, winning four of them.</p>
<p>* Anderlecht won the Cup and league title double in 1965,</p>
<p>1972 and 1994</p>
<p>* As a player for Lierse, Ekeren coach Herman Helleputte was</p>
<p>beaten 4-0 by Anderlecht in the 1976 final.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
